---
/**
 * Architecture of Lumen, drawn from the deep-research-platform repo: README.md, docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md,
 * research-agent/ARCHITECTURE.md and the code (agent/graph.py, agent/tools.py, http_handler.py,
 * backend/app/routers/research.py). Colours come from the design tokens.
 */
---

<figure class="not-prose my-10">
  {/* eslint-disable astro/jsx-a11y/no-noninteractive-tabindex -- scrollable on phones, must be keyboard-reachable */}
  <div
    class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-line bg-cream-soft p-4 sm:p-6"
    tabindex="0"
    role="region"
    aria-label="Lumen architecture diagram (scrolls sideways on small screens)"
  >
    {/* eslint-enable astro/jsx-a11y/no-noninteractive-tabindex */}
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 760 520"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="lu-arch-title lu-arch-desc"
      class="h-auto w-full min-w-[34rem] font-sans"
    >
      <title id="lu-arch-title">Lumen architecture</title>
      <desc id="lu-arch-desc">
        A React frontend sends the question with a JWT to a FastAPI backend. The backend saves the user message in
        PostgreSQL, loads the conversation history and opens a server-sent-events stream to a separate research agent
        service. The agent runs a Deep Agents ReAct loop on LangGraph with one model chosen at startup: Claude Sonnet
        through OpenRouter, or GPT-4o through OpenAI if only that key is set. The loop calls 8 tools. Web search falls
        back from Exa to Tavily to DuckDuckGo, and page reading from Jina Reader to PyMuPDF. Every tool result is cached
        in Redis with its own expiry, from 5 minutes for crypto prices to 24 hours for places. The agent streams a
        checkpoint per tool call, then exactly one of blocks, clarification or error, then done. The backend relays each
        event to the browser and saves the final answer and its blocks in PostgreSQL.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker
          id="lu-arrow"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10"
          refX="9"
          refY="5"
          markerWidth="7"
          markerHeight="7"
          orient="auto-start-reverse"
        >
          <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="var(--color-forest)"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>
      <style>
        .box {
          fill: var(--color-cream);
          stroke: var(--color-forest);
          stroke-width: 1.5;
        }
        .key {
          fill: var(--color-cream);
          stroke: var(--color-pink);
          stroke-width: 3;
        }
        .zone {
          fill: none;
          stroke: var(--color-line);
          stroke-width: 1.5;
          stroke-dasharray: 6 5;
        }
        .t {
          fill: var(--color-forest);
          font-size: 15px;
          font-weight: 600;
        }
        .s {
          fill: var(--color-forest-muted);
          font-size: 12.5px;
        }
        .z {
          fill: var(--color-forest-muted);
          font-size: 12px;
          font-weight: 600;
          letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        }
        .a {
          stroke: var(--color-forest);
          stroke-width: 1.5;
          fill: none;
        }
      </style>

      <!-- Row 1: the three services -->
      <rect class="box" x="10" y="40" width="190" height="96" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="26" y="68">
        React UI
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="26" y="90">
        Vite · TypeScript · Zustand
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="26" y="108">
        BlockRenderer + JSON
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="26" y="124">
        fallback for unknown blocks
      </text>

      <rect class="box" x="275" y="40" width="200" height="96" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="291" y="68">
        FastAPI backend
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="291" y="90">
        JWT auth · conversations
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="291" y="108">
        relays the agent's SSE,
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="291" y="124">
        saves the final answer
      </text>

      <rect class="key" x="550" y="40" width="200" height="96" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="566" y="68">
        Research agent
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="566" y="90">
        FastAPI · Deep Agents
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="566" y="108">
        ReAct loop on LangGraph
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="566" y="124">
        recursion limit 50
      </text>

      <!-- request arrows -->
      <path class="a" d="M200 74 H273" marker-end="url(#lu-arrow)"></path>
      <path class="a" d="M475 74 H548" marker-end="url(#lu-arrow)"></path>
      <!-- stream arrows back -->
      <path class="a" d="M548 112 H477" marker-end="url(#lu-arrow)" stroke-dasharray="5 4"></path>
      <path class="a" d="M273 112 H202" marker-end="url(#lu-arrow)" stroke-dasharray="5 4"></path>
      <text class="s" x="214" y="30">
        query + JWT →
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="478" y="30">
        query + history →
      </text>

      <text class="s" x="10" y="166">
        ← dashed: server-sent events: checkpoint per tool call, then one of
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="10" y="184">
        blocks / clarification / error, then done
      </text>

      <!-- Row 2: storage under backend, model under agent -->
      <rect class="box" x="275" y="214" width="200" height="86" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="291" y="242">
        PostgreSQL 16
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="291" y="264">
        users · conversations
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="291" y="282">
        messages (blocks as JSONB)
      </text>
      <path class="a" d="M375 136 V212" marker-end="url(#lu-arrow)"></path>

      <rect class="box" x="550" y="214" width="200" height="86" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="566" y="242">
        LLM (chosen at startup)
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="566" y="264">
        Claude Sonnet via OpenRouter
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="566" y="282">
        else GPT-4o via OpenAI
      </text>
      <path class="a" d="M650 136 V212" marker-end="url(#lu-arrow)"></path>

      <!-- Row 3: tools zone -->
      <rect class="zone" x="10" y="330" width="740" height="180" rx="14"></rect>
      <text class="z" x="26" y="354">
        8 TOOLS · EVERY RESULT CACHED IN REDIS WITH ITS OWN EXPIRY
      </text>

      <rect class="box" x="26" y="370" width="228" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="40" y="394">
        web_search · 1 h
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="40" y="414">
        Exa → Tavily → DuckDuckGo
      </text>

      <rect class="box" x="266" y="370" width="228" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="280" y="394">
        read_webpage · 6 h
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="280" y="414">
        Jina Reader → PyMuPDF
      </text>

      <rect class="box" x="506" y="370" width="228" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="520" y="394">
        wiki_search · 24 h
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="520" y="414">
        Wikipedia API
      </text>

      <rect class="box" x="26" y="438" width="228" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="40" y="462">
        nearby_places · 24 h
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="40" y="482">
        Nominatim + OSM → map + table
      </text>

      <rect class="box" x="266" y="438" width="228" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="280" y="462">
        latest_news · 15 min
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="280" y="482">
        RSS feeds → table
      </text>

      <rect class="box" x="506" y="438" width="228" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="t" x="520" y="462">
        stock · forex · crypto
      </text>
      <text class="s" x="520" y="482">
        5 min–1 h → insight cards
      </text>

      <path class="a" d="M600 300 V328" marker-end="url(#lu-arrow)"></path>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-forest-muted">
    Drawn from the repo's code and docs. Dashed arrows are the event stream back to the browser. Pink border: where the
    agent loop runs.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
